= The Cooperative Commonwealth Youth Movement

The CCYM is the the youth corps of the CCF. It is populated by young radicals, many of whom intersperse freely with their cousins in the Communist youth organizations. 

- @songs: Let us sing songs in rich, urban, neighbourhoods.  
- @pamphlets: Spread informational pamphlets.
- @ccym_communists: We should address the Communist situation 
- @same: The CCYM is doing fine right now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

